It's the blade that was attached to the tail of the Heretic.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom2_04_s_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"talos","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom2_04_s_81","text":"After Scarlet severed it, I picked it up and restored it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom2_04_s_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"talos","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom2_04_s_82","text":"If you supply power to it, it will generate a great shockwave.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom2_04_s_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"chime","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom2_04_s_83","text":"I appreciate the gift, but what is the purpose behind giving me this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom2_04_s_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"talos","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom2_04_s_84","text":"For self-defense.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom2_04_s_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"talos","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom2_04_s_85","text":"Keep in mind that it can only be used once, after which it will cease to function.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lastkingdom2_04_s_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"kilo","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_lastkingdom2_04_s_86","text":"Since you can't fire a gun, you could use it when your opponent lets their guard d